---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Me - Sajal Choudhary" description="Learn more about me and my work" currentPage="/about/">
  <div class="prose dark:prose-dark mx-auto">
    <h1>About Me</h1>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 my-8">
      <div class="md:w-1/3">
        <img 
          src="/profile/profile.jpeg" 
          alt="Sajal Choudhary" 
          class="rounded-lg shadow-md w-full aspect-square object-cover"
        />
      </div>
      
      <div class="md:w-2/3">
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          Hello! I'm Sajal Choudhary, a [your profession] based in [your location]. I'm passionate about [your main interests and topics].
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-4">
          This website is my digital garden—a place where I cultivate ideas, share my work, and connect with others who share similar interests.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mb-4">
          When I'm not [your primary work], you can find me [your hobbies or other activities].
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- General About Section -->
    <!-- You can add more content about yourself here -->
    
    <!-- Timeline Section -->
    <h2 class="mt-12 mb-8">A Little History</h2>
    
    <div class="timeline-container relative border-l border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark ml-4 md:ml-0 pl-8 md:pl-0 mb-12">
      <div class="timeline-wrapper grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_3fr] gap-4 md:gap-8">
        <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2023</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative mb-12">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2023</div>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Launched My Digital Garden</h3>
            <p>Created this website as a space to share my ideas, writing, and creative work in public. Started documenting my learning journey and connecting with like-minded people online.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2020</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative mb-12">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2020</div>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Started Working at [Company]</h3>
            <p>Joined [Company] as a [Your Role], where I've been focused on [main responsibilities or achievements]. Worked on key projects including [notable project 1] and [notable project 2].</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 3 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2018</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative mb-12">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2018</div>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Graduated from [University]</h3>
            <p>Earned my degree in [Your Field] with a focus on [Your Specialization]. Completed my thesis on [Thesis Topic] and received [any notable awards or distinctions].</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 4 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2015</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative mb-12">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2015</div>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">First Major Project</h3>
            <p>Created [Project Name], which was [impact or significance of the project]. This experience taught me [key lessons] and sparked my interest in [related field or technology].</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 5 -->
        <div class="timeline-date text-right pr-8 hidden md:block">
          <span class="inline-block bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">2010</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-content relative">
          <div class="md:hidden text-sm text-textSecondary dark:text-textSecondaryDark mb-2">2010</div>
          <div class="timeline-marker absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-4 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
          <div class="bg-bgSecondary dark:bg-bgSecondaryDark p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Discovered My Passion</h3>
            <p>Started exploring [Your Field/Passion] after [event or experience that sparked your interest]. Began learning through [resources, courses, or mentors] and built my first [project or achievement].</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <h2>What You'll Find Here</h2>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">🌱</span> Digital Garden
        </h3>
        <p>
          My digital garden consists of interconnected notes and thoughts. These range from seedlings (early ideas) to evergreen notes (well-developed concepts).
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">📝</span> Blog
        </h3>
        <p>
          Longer-form thoughts, tutorials, and articles on [your topics]. These are more polished and comprehensive than garden notes.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">💬</span> Micro
        </h3>
        <p>
          Short thoughts, interesting links, and brief updates—similar to tweets or status updates.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">📸</span> Photos
        </h3>
        <p>
          A gallery of my photography work and visual inspirations that capture moments and ideas.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">📚</span> Books
        </h3>
        <p>
          Books I've published and recommendations for what I'm currently reading or have found valuable.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border border-borderColor dark:border-borderColorDark rounded-lg p-5">
        <h3 class="flex items-center text-xl mb-2">
          <span class="mr-2">✍️</span> Creative Writing
        </h3>
        <p>
          My fiction, poetry, and other creative writing experiments—where I explore storytelling and expression.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <h2>Contact Me</h2>
    
    <p>
      I'm always interested in connecting with like-minded individuals. Feel free to reach out through any of the following:
    </p>
    
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:your.email@example.com">your.email@example.com</a></li>
      <li>Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/yourusername" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@yourusername</a></li>
      <li>LinkedIn: <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/yourusername" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sajal Choudhary</a></li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Colophon</h2>
    
    <p>
      This site was built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a>,
      styled with <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tailwind CSS</a>,
      and deployed on <a href="https://netlify.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Netlify</a>.
      The fonts used are [font names], and the inspiration for the design comes from the sites mentioned in the introduction.
    </p>
  </div>

  <style>
    /* Timeline specific styles */
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .timeline-container {
        position: relative;
      }
      
      .timeline-container:before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 50%;
        width: 2px;
        background-color: var(--color-border);
        transform: translateX(-1px);
      }
    }
    
    .timeline-marker {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--color-bg);
    }
  </style>
</Layout> 